Jsani -<br />
<br />
<font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2"><font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2">Thank you for your interest in our&nbsp;Leaders&nbsp;Save&nbsp;Lives&nbsp;Program! This will be a great opportunity for you to gain&nbsp;leadership skills, and make a difference for your community. Here is&nbsp;the information about the requirements, scholarships, and gift card incentives for the program:</font></font></font></font><br />
<br />
<font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2"><font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2">Blood Drives must between June 1st, 2018 - August 31st, 2018</font></font></font></font><br />
<font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2"><font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2">If you collect at least 25 pints, you are eligible for gift cards and scholarships. The amounts you can win go up with an increase in the number of pints you collect at your drive.</font></font></font></font><br />
<font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2"><font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2">Collect 25-59 pints &ndash; you receive a $50 gift card, and are eligible for a $1000 scholarship</font></font></font></font><br />
<font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2"><font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2">Collect 60-99 pints &ndash; you receive a $100 gift card, and are eligible for a $1500 scholarship</font></font></font></font><br />
<font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2"><font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2">Collect 100+ pints &ndash; you receive a $200 gift card, and are eligible for a $2500 scholarship</font></font></font></font><br />
<br />
<font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2"><font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2">Are you still interested? If so, you can go ahead and get started!&nbsp;</font></font></font></font><br />
<br />
<font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2"><font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2">Here are some steps to take:</font></font></font></font>

<ul>
	<li><font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2"><font color="#212121" size="2">I have attached a Blood Drive Interest Sign-Up that you can use to get an estimated number of donors that would be willing to give at your drive. This just allows them to &ldquo;sign-up&rdquo; to give at your drive even though we haven&rsquo;t set a date yet. Please go ahead and start collecting pledges. This is how we will determine how many staff members and resources we will need to have at your drive. It is also important to acquire as many pledges as possible since some people will inevitably not show up for the drive due to sickness, vacation, or just plain forgetting. It&#39;s really important to make sure you get the potential donor&#39;s contact information. That way, you can call, text, or email them once we have your date booked and you can make their appointment for them then.</font></font></font></li>
	<li><font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2"><font color="#212121" size="2">Please think about a date and location&nbsp;that you would be able to host your drive &ndash; a church, community center, sometimes a parent&rsquo;s workplace will allow you to use their space if they know it is for a scholarship opportunity and blood drive.&nbsp;</font></font></font></li>
	<li><font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2"><font color="#212121" size="2">I&#39;ve also attached our Successful Blood Drive guide. This goes over the basics of a blood drive and how to make sure you are able to collect your goal, which fulfills patients&#39; needs. There are so many more ways you can make this fun and more of an event. Think about ways to&nbsp;personalize the blood drive and this&nbsp;will cause people to give more freely.</font></font></font></li>
</ul>
<br />
<br />
<font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2"><font color="#212121" face="Calibri, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont">If you decide to go forward with the Leaders Save Lives drive, I will need to set up a time to meet with you at the location you are going to use for the drive, so let me know as soon as you can if you want to get a drive scheduled for this summer, and we can set up a time to meet.&nbsp;</font></font></font><br />
<br />
<font color="#212121" size="2"><font size="2"><font color="#212121" face="Calibri, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont">Thank you for your commitment to saving lives through blood donation!</font></font></font><br />
